    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3213680/extras/b4d02d64f65126d9073a075e3128d9db.avif?t=1741021243\" width=611 height=213 /></span><br>In Kitty Rhythm Tower Defense, the kittens are ready to turn any party into a success! This game combines Tower Defense strategy with musical rhythm, challenging you to position musical towers to ensure all the mice are happy. <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3213680/extras/f71d50138ccaddad3df1fd6e31fa0a0c.poster.avif?t=1741021243\" width=610 height=324 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3213680/extras/f71d50138ccaddad3df1fd6e31fa0a0c.webm?t=1741021243\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3213680/extras/f71d50138ccaddad3df1fd6e31fa0a0c.mp4?t=1741021243\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3213680/extras/8010e159b5d7b6396bfc2c4af4610688.avif?t=1741021243\" width=611 height=131 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3213680/extras/7ac426e220afeef7075441db8b6029ab.poster.avif?t=1741021243\" width=610 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3213680/extras/7ac426e220afeef7075441db8b6029ab.webm?t=1741021243\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3213680/extras/7ac426e220afeef7075441db8b6029ab.mp4?t=1741021243\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Each kitten is a tower that plays an instrument, and their actions are synchronized with the beat of the music. As the game progresses, you must hire new musicians to ensure everyone can hear your music well!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3213680/extras/a834f061d41d21bb7ad58da6e7613464.avif?t=1741021243\" width=611 height=130 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3213680/extras/234751328cfcce40eed3949bee48aa4a.poster.avif?t=1741021243\" width=610 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3213680/extras/234751328cfcce40eed3949bee48aa4a.webm?t=1741021243\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3213680/extras/234751328cfcce40eed3949bee48aa4a.mp4?t=1741021243\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>As the maestro, you must coordinate the music and kittens to cheer up the mice and keep the party from losing its rhythm. Manage your energy to prevent the kittens from getting exhausted! <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3213680/extras/c7be061327901b314eb251f802f817da.avif?t=1741021243\" width=611 height=130 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3213680/extras/74507a2c299aeca66b8f0f7b138e9d27.avif?t=1741021243\" data-has-big width=800 height=392 /></span><br>As the game progresses, you can upgrade your towers, significantly increasing their musical power! <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3213680/extras/da26a7e46f96946c39666aee4605700f.avif?t=1741021243\" width=611 height=130 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3213680/extras/d5d40d1af88de1bd6fcb43c9ed96e15f.poster.avif?t=1741021243\" width=610 height=324 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3213680/extras/d5d40d1af88de1bd6fcb43c9ed96e15f.webm?t=1741021243\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3213680/extras/d5d40d1af88de1bd6fcb43c9ed96e15f.mp4?t=1741021243\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3213680/extras/e9bc51d5f5cfc6b7e006896c7475e55d.avif?t=1741021243\" width=611 height=131 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Defeat the Boss!</strong></h2> Coming soon...",
